{"author":{"id":"746a4d30afc20b78119cb8ed7c194f988174fc252f0e9d9eb92022244ef86db3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1776835446,"nonce":"tUSQ20myUBxN2x5ymRilALxeevo=","metadata":{"github-id":"I_kwDOK4fCvM8AAAABALW1ow","github-url":"https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/issues/69","origin":"github"},"title":"Record FCU servo output and nav controller output in bag","message":"## Summary\n\nAdd two mavros topics to `bizzyboat.yaml`'s recording list so session\nbags capture the FCU's control effort — what ArduPilot is actually\ncommanding the thrusters/servos to do, and how hard its internal nav\ncontroller is working to follow our `cmd_vel` inputs.\n\nToday we record the _commands_ going into the FCU\n(`/bizzy/piloting_mode/autonomous/cmd_vel`,\n`/bizzy/mavros/setpoint_velocity/cmd_vel`) but not the FCU's _output_\nor internal feedback.  That leaves a gap when diagnosing:\n\n- Why is the boat crabbing hard on this line?  Is it because current\n  is overpowering the thrusters, or because the controller is\n  saturated?\n- When hover drifts, is the throttle being commanded but not\n  producing enough thrust, or is the controller idle?\n- What does the loop look like during the line-3 abort or similar\n  failure modes?\n\n## Topics to add\n\n| Topic | Message type | What it gives us |\n|---|---|---|\n| `/bizzy/mavros/rc/out` | `mavros_msgs/RCOut` | Per-channel PWM output (8 channels) — the actual servo / ESC commands leaving the FCU. |\n| `/bizzy/mavros/nav_controller_output` | `mavros_msgs/NavControllerOutput` | ArduRover's internal desired-vs-actual state: `nav_bearing`, `target_bearing`, `desired_speed`, `xtrack_error`, etc.  Shows how hard the boat is steering / accelerating to hit our command. |\n\nBoth are ~10 Hz at default mavros stream rates, negligible bag size.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- ESC bidirectional telemetry (RPM / current / voltage per thruster)\n  — requires DShot firmware on the thruster ESCs and wiring change.\n  Worth a separate issue if interested.\n- Bumping the SR1_EXT_STAT / SR1_RC_CHAN stream rates above 10 Hz.\n  Default is fine for the question \"was the controller working hard?\"\n- Pulling ArduPilot dataflash logs after each session (higher-rate,\n  richer PID internals) — separate workflow.\n\n## Change\n\nTwo lines added to `bizzyboat_project11/config/bizzyboat.yaml` under\nthe `/**/logger:` section.\n\n---\n**Authored-By**: `Claude Code Agent`\n**Model**: `Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context)`","files":null}]}